                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p style="margin-top:10px;margin-left:75px"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: -1px;font-size: 30px">   绍兴市教育教学研究院办公室关于</span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:2px;margin-left:30px"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: -1px;font-size: 30px"><span style="font-family:宋体">   举行</span>2026年校本研修专题论文评选的通知</span></strong></p><p style="line-height:141%"><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 14px"> </span></p><p style="line-height:141%"><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 14px"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:7px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">各区、县</span>(市)教师发展中心、进修学校：</span></p><p style="margin-top:15px;margin-right:24px;text-indent:42px;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:148%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 148%;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 21px">为加强全市校本研修研究，总结推广相关经验，促进全市</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 148%;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">校本研修质量的提升，经研究，决定组织开展</span>2026年绍兴市校</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 148%;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px">本研修专题论文评选，现将有关事项通知如下：</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-left:42px"><strong><span style="font-family: 黑体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px">一、评选范围</span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:15px;margin-left:42px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 21px">全市师训机构、各类中小学及幼儿园</span></p><p style="margin-top:15px;margin-left:42px"><strong><span style="font-family: 黑体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px">二、论文主题</span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:15px;margin-left:42px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px; letter-spacing: 1px;">基于教师师德的校本研修、基于教师专业阅读的校本研修</span></p><p style="margin-top:15px;margin-left:42px"><strong><span style="font-family: 黑体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px">三、选送数量</span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:15px;margin-right:7px;text-indent:42px;line-height:149%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 149%;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">各地选送篇目数上限如下：诸暨市</span>10篇，越城区、柯桥</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 149%;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px">区、</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 149%;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">上虞区各</span>8篇，嵊州市7篇，新昌县及市直各6篇。</span></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 14px">
</span></p><p style="line-height:106%"><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 14px">          </span><strong><span style="font-family: 黑体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px">四、评选方法</span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:15px;text-indent:43px;line-height:148%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">依据《绍兴市教育教学研究院关于印发</span><20</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 21px">26年绍兴市教学</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">活动比赛办法</span>>的通知》(绍市教研字〔2026〕</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 21px">2号)的文件要</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px">求进行评选、公示以及发文公布。</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-left:43px"><strong><span style="font-family: 黑体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px">五、论文报送要求</span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:16px;margin-right:3px;text-indent:43px;line-height:148%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 21px">参评论文应符合一般论文的写作要求，做到言之有物，逻</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 21px">  </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">辑严密，语言表达规范，字数一般不超过</span>6000</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 21px">字。已公开发表</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">的论文不再参评。参评论文作者署名不得多于</span>2人。同</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 21px">一篇论文</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px">只能参加研究院一个类别的评审。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 21px;">纸质稿一式4份(其中1份在文章标题下行注明作者单位、</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 21px;">姓名、联系电话，其余3份隐去上述内容)。正文中不得出现作</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 21px;">者姓名、单位、联系电话、所在地区等信息。</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:7px;text-indent:43px;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:147%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 21px">论文用</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 21px">word</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 21px">文档</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 21px">A4</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: -3px;font-size: 21px"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">纸打印。论文格式：题目</span>(居中</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 21px">，四号</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 2px;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">黑体</span>)、单位与姓名(居中，小四号楷体)、摘要与关键词(</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">五号楷体</span>)、正文(小四号宋体、1.5倍行距)</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:7px;text-indent:43px;line-height:150%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 21px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);">请各参评者<span style="text-indent: 43px; font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 21px;">于6月25日前将论文及选送篇目汇总表(见附件) 纸质稿与电子稿报送给教科室沈初见老师(逾期恕不受理)。</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋"><span style="text-indent: 43px; font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 21px;"></span>各单位于</span>6月30日前将所有资料<span style="font-family:仿宋">报送给研究院许博老师</span>(逾期恕不受理)。</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:7px;text-indent:43px;line-height:150%"><strong><span style="font-family: 黑体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px">六、评审承诺</span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:7px;text-indent:43px;line-height:150%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px; letter-spacing: 0px;">凡参加教育教学论文评审的作者，须提交论文查重报告，</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px; letter-spacing: 2px;">并填写《绍兴市教育教学论文评审承诺书》</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px; letter-spacing: 2px;">(见附件2),承诺</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 148%; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 20px;">其教育教学论文的原创性、真实性，同意在市研究院网站上公</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 148%; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 20px;">开论文，并经由所在单位签署意见，加盖公章。</span></p><p style="margin-top:2px;margin-left:43px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 20px">未尽事宜可与研究院许博老师联系。</span></p><p style="margin-top:2px;margin-left:43px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 20px">附件1 </span><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 24px">绍兴市校本研修论文评审选送篇目汇总表</span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:2px;margin-left:43px"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 24px"></span></strong></p><p style="line-height: 16px;"><img style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 2px;" src="http://10.176.17.2/UEditor/dialogs/attachment/fileTypeImages/icon_doc.gif" /><a style="font-size:12px; color:#0066cc;" href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/4/202604141603308451.docx" title="202604141603308451.docx">202604141603308451.docx</a></p><p style="margin-top:2px;margin-left:43px">附件 2   <strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 24px">绍兴市校本研修论文评审承诺书</span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:2px;margin-left:43px"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 24px"></span></strong></p><p style="line-height: 16px;"><img style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 2px;" src="http://10.176.17.2/UEditor/dialogs/attachment/fileTypeImages/icon_doc.gif" /><a style="font-size:12px; color:#0066cc;" href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/4/202604141605381560.docx" title="202604141605381560.docx">202604141605381560.docx</a></p><p style="margin-top:2px;margin-left:43px"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 24px"></span></strong>
</p><p style="margin-top:2px;margin-left:43px"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 24px"></span></strong>
</p><p style="margin-top:2px;margin-left:43px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 20px"></span>
</p><p>
</p>
    
